Package: difftastic
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, shared-mime-info${dist:Depends}
Description: structural diff tool that understands syntax
 Difftastic is a structural diff tool that compares files based on their
 syntax rather than line by line. It parses the files with tree-sitter,
 builds a syntax tree for each side and reports exactly which pieces of
 syntax changed, so reformatting or re-indentation is not reported as a
 change.
 .
 Over 30 languages are supported; files with an unrecognised extension fall
 back to a line-oriented diff with word highlighting. Difftastic can be used
 standalone or as an external diff command for git, mercurial, jj and fossil.
 .
 The command provided by this package is difft.
